        "TileImage": "$($repository de0d2376-2887-4eeb-a5fb-e48d21ee04ae).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. Your next target is Helfried Ziegler, a suspected bike thief. Helfried has been noticed snooping around bikes by a powerful local &amp; bicycle enthusiast. When our client began noticing bike thefts in the local area, low &amp; behold, Helfried was always close by. So with no video proof, or eyewitness proof, or really any solid proof? Our client wants retribution for bike riders everywhere. Going with gut feeling here. Take this bikeless basterd out 47. I&apos;ll leave you to prepare.",
